      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city officially incorporated on October 26, 1955, establishing its own municipal government.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/La_Palma%2C_California",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Originally called Dairyland, La Palma was one of three dairy cities in the area before the dairies moved east in 1965.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
